---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: QR codes for the forms
description: Printable QR codes for the district's forms.
permalink: /qr/
noindex: true
bodyClass: print-page
---
<div class="wrap section">
  <h1>QR codes for the forms</h1>
  <p class="lead">Print this page for district meetings. Each code opens the form on a phone.</p>
  <div class="qr-grid">
    {%- for q in qr %}
    <figure class="qr">
      {{ q.svg | safe }}
      <figcaption><strong>{{ q.title }}</strong><br><span class="small">{{ q.url }}</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
